  "title": "Blue Origin and NASA Collaborate on Mars Telecommunications",
  "summary": "Blue Origin is selected by NASA to develop a high-performance Mars telecommunications orbiter for future missions, marking a partnership between the two organizations. NASA also awarded a contract to Omitron Inc. for orbital safety analysis services and added Blue Origin’s New Glenn 9×4 launch service to its Launch Services Program Office for future missions. This collaboration aims to enhance spaceflight safety and mission capabilities.",
